        <p><seg source="#source-3085-3111">一　金森建策筆記</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-3111-3143">一　宗對馬守義功家譜</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-3143-3157">一　隋書</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-3157-3180">一　大清一統圖</seg></p>
